usage: record.py [-h] --parents PARENTS --source-root SOURCE_ROOT --prepared
                 PREPARED --adb ADB --output OUTPUT
                 (--initialize | --slot SLOT | --finish) [--runtime RUNTIME]
                 [--device DEVICE] [--toolchain-inputs TOOLCHAIN_INPUTS]
                 [--tooling TOOLING] [--accept-package-data-removal]

Record eight fixed fresh installs and five unconditional frames after one
NEXT. The command/acquisition sequence derives from the pinned editor
recorder. This independent report never invokes its settling policy or changes
a parent plan.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --parents PARENTS
  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT
  --prepared PREPARED
  --adb ADB
  --output OUTPUT
  --initialize
  --slot SLOT
  --finish
  --runtime RUNTIME
  --device DEVICE
  --toolchain-inputs TOOLCHAIN_INPUTS
  --tooling TOOLING
  --accept-package-data-removal
